'''Day of the Cat''' (222 ～猫の日～, ''222 ~Neko no Hi'', '''222 ~Cat Day~''') is an event that appears annually, around February 22nd, which is Japan's Cat's Day.

==Event Information==
Invasion of the Black Cats!<br>
The DAY OF THE CAT is upon us! Limited events start NOW!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between Feb 22 (11am) and March 1, {{CURRENTYEAR}} (11am)!'''}}

*{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Limited Edition Stages!'''}}
The Killer Cats are marching into the heart of the Cat Empire! Will this Day of the Cat be the Day of Doom for the Cat Army??<br>
Login to the Stories of Legend/Event Stages in The Battle Cats to challenge the {{Color|#FF0000|'''Day of the Cat'''}} map!

Clear the limited stages for the rare chance to collect the special Cat {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Killer Cat'''}}, only available from this event!

Later stages on the map give you a better chance to pick up this limited edition unit! (Or you can use a Treasure Radar for a 100% chance!)<br>
<small>※Activate the Killer Cats after collecting them by visiting the Rare Cats section of the Upgrade menu.<br>
※Please update The Battle Cats to the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''most recent version'''}} to access these stages and events.</small>

*{{Color|#FF6D01|'''Login Bonuses each day during this event!'''}}
Log in to The Battle Cats app for a gift of {{Color|#FF0000|'''22 Cat Food every day!'''}}<br>
Play every day and collect ALL THE CAT FOOD!

Don't miss out on this awesome chance for free stuff!

